{"id":3301,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>8月24日上午8:30，机械工程学院2026年度山西省研究生创新项目评审答辩会在线上举行。本次评审旨在选拔培育优质科研项目，进一步激发研究生的科研创新活力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmTLfLR-ZLRUiMM87iMRGinl-Zoz9oiM4TRnmVknmG8olL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysMYyDLSyYUzNDM7LbMlW2L7Q7Ulnfnmv4nRliMRlaLmfFL8lbUmTVLlnFLm7YU4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E77612A964C95BF0FDADAF73D5545020/3E9B9E1D/212C5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmTLfLR-ZLRUiMM87iMRGinl-Zoz9oiM4TRnmVknmG8olL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysMYyDLSyYUzNDM7LbMlW2L7Q7Ulnfnmv4nRliMRlaLmfFL8lbUmTVLlnFLm7YU4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png\"></p><p>答辩过程中，申报学生围绕立项依据、研究内容、技术路线及预期成果等方面逐一进行汇报。项目选题紧贴学科前沿与工程需求，充分展现了研究生扎实的专业功底与敏锐的学术洞察力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozUL4MlCaLRlYLMzvinmCbnmNZLzCobnmCiUNWVMmNPLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfnSybnSyDUmCPoz9in77YL4WVL462nNrRolVRUmGsnNWFMmL4LlWfUlrFMN-DoRlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5AE9E6B61985DA232E37FFEC9ACB07FB/6331BAAE/6B685\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozUL4MlCaLRlYLMzvinmCbnmNZLzCobnmCiUNWVMmNPLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfnSybnSyDUmCPoz9in77YL4WVL462nNrRolVRUmGsnNWFMmL4LlWfUlrFMN-DoRlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png\"></p><p>评审专家组秉持严谨客观的态度，从项目创新性、可行性及应用价值等多个维度进行了严格把关，并针对研究思路的优化和后续工作的推进提出了具有建设性的指导意见，现场学术交流氛围浓厚。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=goRQL2o7nVoRWVoMzT7U474MmvYL8CoYU8rkL7lPU4VRU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVn1yZLYhVnzVVLNVkL8-4UzUaozLaoRMfM7LDUl7aMlQFLzfRL7CZMRfFMmGYM4NJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2EF83EE1E2AB3B3A4093083A4C6AA05F/10C0F840/60279\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=goRQL2o7nVoRWVoMzT7U474MmvYL8CoYU8rkL7lPU4VRU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVn1yZLYhVnzVVLNVkL8-4UzUaozLaoRMfM7LDUl7aMlQFLzfRL7CZMRfFMmGYM4NJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png\"></p><p>此次线上评审为研究生搭建了展示学术成果的优质平台，进一步营造了学院良好的科研生态。后续，学院将依据综合评审结果按程序择优推荐立项，全力支持研究生科研创新工作迈向新台阶。</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmTLfLR-ZLRUiMM87iMRGinl-Zoz9oiM4TRnmVknmG8olL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysMYyDLSyYUzNDM7LbMlW2L7Q7Ulnfnmv4nRliMRlaLmfFL8lbUmTVLlnFLm7YU4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzCsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41167&e=.png"}